Gneiss's VS Code theme (vscode/themes/gneiss-color-theme.json) is a fork of
Nord's VS Code theme, version 0.19.0, from
https://github.com/nordtheme/visual-studio-code. It started as the same choice
of color for each part of the editor, with Gneiss's colors in place of Nord's,
and is maintained here on its own. Gneiss's base colors started as Nord's
palette. Nord is under the MIT License below.

